    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051105.0075\n\nHONG KONG, Nov. 5 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nResults from Hong Kong Open badminton\n\n\n\n\nFollowing are the results from the 250,000 US dollar Hong Kong Open badminton championship here Saturday (prefxi number denotes seeding):\n\nMen's singles\n\nSemi-finals\n\n1-Lin Dan, China, bt 4-Lee Chong-wei, Malaysia, 15-4, 15-6.\n\nWomen's singles\n\nSemi-finals\n\n1-Zhang Ning, China, bt 4-Pi Hongyan, France, 11-3, 13-11",
